# payment-api-nest rules

- Domain: AcmePay (fictional). Never import StarsPay code or real PSP credentials.
- Money: integer minor units only. Prisma BigInt in DB; JSON as integers. No float for amounts.
- FX `rate` is a decimal string, never a float.
- Shared contract: `Docs/specs/API_CONTRACT.md`, codes in `Docs/specs/error-codes.md`.
- Routes must match `/v1/*` exactly (`@Controller('v1/...')`).
- New payment features: follow `.cursor/skills/nest-payment-module/SKILL.md`.
- Spec first, then Jest test, then implementation, then update spec checkboxes.
- Prefer class-validator DTOs, Guards for auth, BullMQ processors for async side effects.
- Error envelope: `{ error: { code, name, message, details } }`.
